      "intro": "We turn sand into GPUs. There are a few steps in the middle, but procurement asked me to keep this simple. Bring sand from Ocean Beach and I’ll pay {sandPrice} coins per sack.",
      "repeat": true,
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "Sell one sack of sand · {sandPrice} coins",
